# E-Commerce Website

I built this project to practice frontend development and improve my understanding of how multi-page websites are structured and designed.
While working on it, I focused on building a clean layout, connecting different pages together, and making the website more interactive using JavaScript.
The project includes pages such as Home, Shop, Product, Cart, and Contact. Through this project, I learned more about responsive design, organizing frontend code, and improving the overall user experience and navigation between pages.
This project was built using HTML5, CSS3, Vanilla JavaScript.
